# HY300PRO-G-EU -- the maintainer's own HY300 Pro (box label HY300PRO-G-EU, stock Android 11
# of 2025-05-06). HY310-like where measured: DDR3 at 792 MHz with the HY310's DRAM words, the
# HY310's 26-entry partition table on a 15273600-sector eMMC, the HY310's display.bin.
# Not the HY300 Pro of issue #1 (boards/hy300-pro). Nobody has run our firmware on it, so
# STATUS is profile-only and it gets TEST images only (release/build-all.sh --test-image).
BOARD_ID=hy300pro-g-eu
STATUS=profile-only
VERIFIED_BY=
PROFILE=hy300pro_g_eu
IMAGE_NAME=h713-hy300pro-g-eu
# kernel patch 0167 (package GEU1): the HY310's tree plus this board's lamp PWM words
KERNEL_DTB=sun50i-h713-hy300pro-g-eu
# U-Boot base hy300pro_g_eu_defconfig (package GEU1): hy310_defconfig with this board's
# device tree, name and tpr0..tpr2
UBOOT_BOARD=hy300pro_g_eu
# Optional hardware (boards/README.md, FEATURES; README.md "Hardware this board does not have"):
# none confirmed (two absent, one unknown and probed on the first boot). camera: no lens by eye (maintainer statement; verify on mainline by whether a
# capture device appears). focus-motor: none (maintainer statement, consistent with the stock DT's
# motor_ctr status = "disabled"; confirm on the device). accelerometer: unknown - the stock DT
# lists three candidate chips and does not say which, if any, is fitted; the kernel tree (0167)
# leaves the HY310's SC7A20 node at 0x18 on so that the first boot's probe answers it.
FEATURES=
